WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:11.220
The history of gaming extends 5,000 
years into the past to ancient Egypt.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.720
Ancient games foretold the 
futures of men and kings.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.200
They were magic ceremonies that 
determined a person's fate.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.340
These ceremonies were known 
as the "Shadow Games."

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.990
In the present, a young boy 
solves the Millennium Puzzle.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.210
He becomes the heir to the Shadow Games.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.300
This boy possesses two hearts - 
one of light and one of darkness.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.210
He is known as "Yu-Gi-Oh."

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.340
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.250
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.000
Game cartridges are stacked 
in the corner of the room

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.700
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.800
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.170
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:26.100
You don't change your 
facial expression at all

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.350
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.620
These feelings don't reach 
you, don't reach you

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:46.360
What is truly precious?

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:56.290
Transfer all your shares 
in Kaiba Corporation to me.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:01.690
We understand, but we have one condition.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:06.870
Defeating Yugi will be very easy.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.510
What?

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.440
Mokuba!  Let him go!

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.640
I'll consider it if you win the duel.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.920
Who's my opponent?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.620
He's already here.  Look!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.290
Kaiba?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:40.140
Resurrection!  Magical Hats

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:48.360
Yugi, you're going to 
battle Seto Kaiba's ghost.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.180
What?

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:50.680
What do you mean?

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.690
Just like I said, Seto Kaiba is dead.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.690
What?

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.400
That's a lie!  My brother isn't dead!

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.000
It's not a lie.  He died hating Yugi Muto.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.500
Standing there is Kaiba's ghost.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.500
That's ridiculous.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.400
Well, Yugi?

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:12.500
Will you battle him or not?

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:17.140
Fine!  I'll uncover that 
fake's true identity!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.760
Seto Kaiba is dead?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.150
Yes, that's what I heard.

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:26.840
Oh no!  What terrible news!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.720
So that's why you have that phony?

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.520
It doesn't please you?

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.890
It's fine.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:36.080
I'll watch this for entertainment.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.760
Forgive me for asking, but this 
is just for entertainment?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:42.900
Yugi boy will definitely come to me.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:47.810
And I will bury him with my own hands.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.810
Yugi, I died.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:55.840
That's a lie!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:04:01.890
Since I lost to you, I lost 
everything, including my life.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.720
I'll never forgive you.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.600
I'm wandering through Hell, and 
I'll drag you down here to join me.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.100
Did you really think a 
fake ghost would scare me?

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:19.340
You can only say that 
after you defeat my deck.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:23.840
Even if you can imitate Kaiba's 
apperance, you can't imitate his deck.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.330
You'd like that, wouldn't you.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.400
You can't kill my brother that easily!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.280
Yugi, don't listen to him!  It's all lies!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.530
That's right!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:42.160
Yugi, your opponents on this island 
aren't all normal participants.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.290
He is the first of several assassins

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:48.240
that Industrial Illusions sent 
to this island to defeat you.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:53.940
Kaiba's ghost will give you emotional 
trauma, causing you to lose.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:58.480
When that happens, Kaiba Corporation 
will belong to Mr. Pegasus.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.250
We'll each wager three Star Chips.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:05.370
Fine!  I'll wager my three 
remaining Star Chips!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.520
Duel.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.970
It's my turn.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.700
I attack with Hitotsu-Me Giant.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:26.960
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.170
It's your turn.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:33.980
Kaiba definitely had Hitotsu-Me 
Giant in his deck.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:37.620
My brother also had that card in his deck.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:41.410
That doesn't mean that's Kaiba's actual deck.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:49.700
There's no way a phony can have Kaiba's deck.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.160
This is a trick.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.330
I'll battle with this card.

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.940
Dark Magician, attack!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.290
Black Magic!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.170
Hitotsu-Me Giant is destroyed.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.620
You're strong as usual.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.990
That guy...

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:18.690
Yugi seems to be losing his cool.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:24.800
Yugi, I can read your mind 
like the back of my hand.

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:32.410
You're thinking, "Is that 
really Kaiba's deck?"

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.480
And you're right.

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.710
This is Seto Kaiba's real deck.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:42.210
Kaiba is dead, and his hatred 
resides in this deck.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.180
Kaiba isn't dead!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.620
I don't believe your ridiculous lies!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.400
You're bluffing.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.360
No, I'm not!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.890
It's better for you if you believe me.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.650
What do you mean?

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.130
You don't have Exodia.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:04.450
Can you beat Seto Kaiba's deck without it?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.130
What?

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.920
Suicide.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.500
It saves us the trouble of locking him up.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.640
Checking voice print: State your name.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.250
Seto Kaiba.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.780
Verified.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.760
Long time no see, Master Seto.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.240
What transpired while I was gone?

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.400
The board of directors held a meeting.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.360
What did they decide?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:53.920
If certain conditions are met, 
50% of The Big Five's stock...

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:59.520
...will be transferred to Pegasus 
J. Crawford of Industrial Illusions.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.750
What conditions?

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:07.190
Pegasus J. Crawford has organized 
the Duelist Kingdom tournament.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:11.850
The stock will be transferred 
if Yugi Muto is defeated there.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:16.540
Pegasus intends to take 
over Kaiba Corporation.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.920
But Yugi has the mighty Exodia.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.740
He won't be defeated easily.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:34.960
Reports indicate that Yugi 
Muto has lost Exodia.

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:36.290
What?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.440
Any further questions?

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.030
I haven't seen Mokuba.  Where is he?

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:47.370
Pegasus invited him to Duelist Kingdom.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:50.000
Mokuba has the key to the

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.810
storage facility that houses the documents 
needed to transfer my company.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:57.840
Pegasus kidnapped Mokuba.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.130
What will you do?

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.720
I promise to rescue Mokuba.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:06.920
But first, I have to stop Pegasus 
from taking over my company.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.050
I need Yugi to win, no matter what.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:14.040
Someone will soon realize that 
I'm working at this terminal.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.360
It's a battle against time.  Help me.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.560
Understood.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.870
First, find the location using 
the general user network.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.470
Search for Duelist Kingdom.

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:33.410
It's your turn.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.320
Here I go.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:40.320
The envoy of revenge resurrects from Hell.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.410
Prepare yourself, Yugi.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.100
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:56.800
What?

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.300
Blue-Eyes White Dragon?

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:03.040
No way!  That's really my brother's deck?

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.340
Surprised?

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:33.540
That's really Kaiba's deck?

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:37.540
That means Kaiba really is dead?

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.920
Let me guess what you're thinking.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.970
"Kaiba really died?"  Am I wrong?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.680
No one can imitate Kaiba's deck.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:52.220
This really is my deck.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:58.030
My Blue-Eyes White Dragon 
is filled with hatred,

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.960
resurrecting so that it can get revenge!

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.970
Tell me that he's lying!

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:10.690
Come with me to Hell.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:17.820
Search complete.  Located Duelist Kingdom.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.590
Which Duel Rings are currently in operation?

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:24.590
Twelve throughout the island.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:29.600
Okay, find the booth where 
Yugi Muto is dueling.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:33.100
Searching.  Please wait.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.480
Access denied?

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:43.170
Correct. Yugi Muto's duel 
data is unaccessible.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.930
No way...

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.480
I get it.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:50.040
Pegasus is up to something.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.320
So Yugi's duel data is a trade secret.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.750
Awaiting next order.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:59.260
In that case, I'll break 
in and find Yugi's booth.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:01.240
I'll use back channels.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.440
How?

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.570
Like this.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:09.900
The island's duel data are 
relayed via satellite...

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:13.300
...and simultaneously 
recorded to Millennium,

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.600
Industrial Illusions's central computer.

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:20.180
If I use a back door to 
break into Millennium,

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:23.310
I can access Yugi's booth 
data as it's being recorded.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:28.820
Hacking?  But the company has 
a powerful firewall program.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:34.560
All systems are based on the virtual 
system, and I'm the one who designed it.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.960
So I know I can reach the virtual booth.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.530
But I can't perform a search without data.

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:43.670
Yes, you can.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:48.360
If Yugi is dueling, it is likely that 
Dark Magician will appear on the field.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.010
So search for Dark Magician.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:56.020
Understood.  Linking Dark Magician's 
data to the search program.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:59.440
Good.  I'll begin hacking into Millennium.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.580
Understood.  As the first step,

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:06.190
accessing the communication satellite 
Illusion Satellite 2 via back door.

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.720
Perform a virtual purge on the security wall.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:10.280
Initiate stealth mode.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.450
Understood.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.280
Stealth mode confirmed.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.010
Begin the purge.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.100
Purge complete.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:39.400
Breaching Illusion Satellite 
2's security wall.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:43.700
Good.  Begin landing via 
back door to Millennium.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:46.690
Understood.  Beginning landing.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:03.690
Industrial Illusions sighted.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.080
They're unaware of what's happening.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:11.840
Step two: Break into the company's 
central computer, Millennium.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:16.610
Understood.  Entering 
Millennium's digital dungeon.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.680
I won't attack this turn.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:30.310
Before that, I'll get ready to 
block your monsters' escape routes.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:38.970
Is that a spell card or trap card?

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:42.370
I switch Dark Magician to defense position.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:46.730
I play Curse of Dragon in defense position.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.800
I knew you'd do that.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.230
Feel my revenge.

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:57.840
I activate the trap card Defense Paralysis.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:58.840
What?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:08.480
All your monsters switch to attack position.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.210
What?

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.420
Yugi!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:11.770
This is bad.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.590
As long as Defense Paralysis 
is on his field,

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.040
he can definitely damage my life points.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.520
Go Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.210
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.970
Curse of Dragon is destroyed.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.450
Yugi!

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.120
It's not that booth either.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.120
How many is left?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.730
Only one.  Booth #146.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.890
No one is dueling?

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.090
That's impossible.  Enter Booth #146!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.530
Understood.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.600
What's wrong?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.440
It froze.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.940
Reboot!

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:07.940
Reboot completed.

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.340
Re-access Booth #146.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.950
It froze.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.200
Reasons unknown.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.450
I see.  Hold up.

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.010
This is it.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.120
The freeze is nothing more than camouflage.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.750
Something inside is reacting 
to our search data.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.930
Dark Magician is on the field inside.

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.160
There's no mistake.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.230
Yugi is inside.

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.900
How will you get in?

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:41.940
Set a keyhole destruction 
program and blow up the door!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.250
Understood.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:49.820
What's this?

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:54.850
This building is actually a room 
set aside for data storage.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:18:01.070
Yugi's duel data is currently 
being recorded inside this room.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:05.690
But you cannot enter without a password.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:11.400
So Pegasus, you're saying it's an 
island prison where once I enter,

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.610
I can never leave.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:14.640
But that won't happen!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:16.140
I'm going in!

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.880
What's the password?

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.250
Alcatraz!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.250
This isn't good.  Is there no way I can win?

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:31.320
Yugi, Kaiba is enjoying your 
defeat from the afterlife.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:35.370
My brother isn't dead!  He's not!

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.680
Yugi, remember what you told me?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.800
You said my brother would return!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:46.810
I believe you!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.580
I'll wait for my brother forever!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.120
Mokuba, I hear you.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.680
I'll also believe.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:57.420
I'll believe that Kaiba is alive.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.220
I won't lose!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:04.170
I combo Magical Hats with Dark Magician.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:13.870
So Dark Magician is hiding 
inside one of the Magical Hats.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.540
Attack me with Burst Stream!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:20.810
But your odds for success 
are only one in four.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:23.520
What's wrong?

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:26.810
If you really are a ghost 
who's seeking revenge...

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.320
If you really want to bury me...

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.720
Then fire!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.040
Awesome, Yugi!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:36.370
If you pull this off, you can 
avoid Blue-Eyes's attack.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.320
Yugi...

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:42.800
Unlocked.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.290
Entering Alcatraz.

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.000
It's only getting started.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.120
Pegasus, I'll show you what I can do!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.930
Let the battle begin!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:11.420
This is idiotic.  You're 
only stalling for time.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:14.190
Say whatever you want.  Now fire!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.830
As you wish, I'll blow them apart one by one.

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.730
Burst Stream!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:37.280
Yugi managed to survive Blue-Eyes's 
attack, but he's still in a pinch.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:40.780
If it's Kaiba's deck, it has 
three copies of Blue-Eyes.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.440
At this rate, Yugi will be...

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:45.480
What?  Blue-Eyes is vanishing?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.270
Is someone helping Yugi?

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.600
Fake Kaiba reveals his true identity.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.880
You don't need to hold back 
anymore!  Finish him, Yugi!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.360
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Blue-Eyes White Dragon's Counterattack

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.370
Duel, standby!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:09.790
The flask glistens

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:17.640
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:26.620
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:34.390
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:40.220
Shower of happiness

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:44.330
I will shower you with it

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:52.610
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:56.850
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.110 --> 00:22:00.970
You are not alone

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:07.690
You're protected by a 
giant ring of friendship
